  "story": {
    "day": 88,
    "title": "Kaya's Day of Discovery",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya woke fast before the twentieth day of spring.",
      "Her school subject was California and Indonesia’s Bali island.",
      "She read about a religious battle, a witch, and Mt. Shasta.",
      "Also, a ninth-century cent coin from the fortieth page was noted.",
      "Her teammate helped them use a ruler for the poster block.",
      "They had to listen for the point of their fine project.",
      "After school, Kaya went shopping at the mall for a change.",
      "She walked along the street for a mile to a new place.",
      "At the corner, she needed a shirt, skirt, jeans, cap, shoe, sock.",
      "Her old problem was theirs; she had to pay one thousand yen.",
      "Hungry, she put her towel on a plate, took a bath and shower.",
      "She wanted to dance, but went straight to bed. A child on the thirtieth floor across the wall had no excuse to turn or open."
    ]
  }
